    "text": "Crypto Week Crashes as Procedural Battles Threaten Digital Asset Oversight\nBy PYMNTS,\n4 hours agoIt’s not every week that a sector with a checkered past gets the regulatory green light in the U.S. And it may not be this week, either, at least not for the cryptocurrency sector’s “Crypto Week” legislative sprint, during which three major crypto bills — GENIUS (stablecoin regulation), CLARITY (digital asset classification) and the Anti-CBDC Act — are being put forward by lawmakers.",
